```text
A network plugin reports a ``pciPath`` used for topology discovery. It normally
points at a device path under ``/sys``. Virtual interfaces may not have a usable
PCI path and can report a null path. Plugin properties also report pointer
support, speed, latency, and device-offload information.
```
